{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22066","headline":"新乐府 两朱阁\t刺佛寺寖多也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 两朱阁\t刺佛寺寖多也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两朱阁，南北相对起。\n借问何人家，贞元双帝子。\n帝子吹箫双得仙，五云飘颻飞上天。\n第宅亭台不将去，化爲佛寺在人间。\n妆合伎楼何寂静，柳似舞腰池似镜。\n花落黄昏悄悄时，不闻歌吹闻钟磬。\n寺门敕牓金字书，尼院佛庭宽有余。\n青苔明月多闲地，比屋疲人无处居。\n忆昨平阳宅初置，吞幷平人几家地。\n仙去双双作梵宫，渐恐人间尽爲寺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}